*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f4f5f7;color:#20252d;font:14px/1.6 system-ui,sans-serif}main{max-width:1220px;margin:auto;padding:36px 22px 70px}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:center}h1{font-size:27px;margin:4px 0}h2{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 14px}small,.muted{color:#65707e}.brand{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.15em;color:#a23e32;font-weight:700}.panel{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e0e4e9;border-radius:15px;padding:22px;margin-top:22px}.notice{border-left:3px solid #c44a36;padding-left:14px}button,a{font:inherit}button{border:1px solid #d2d8df;background:#fff;color:#20252d;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 14px;cursor:pointer}button.primary{background:#20252d;color:#fff;border-color:#20252d}button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #c44a36;outline-offset:3px}button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:wait}.controls{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.label{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:#6b7380}.value{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;overflow-wrap:anywhere}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#f8f9fa;border-radius:9px;padding:16px;max-height:360px;overflow:auto;font-size:12px}.scroll{overflow:auto;max-height:560px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px}th,td{padding:11px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f3;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}th{color:#6b7380;white-space:nowrap;position:sticky;top:0;background:#fff;z-index:1}td{min-width:90px;max-width:290px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.error{color:#a32e2e}#status{min-height:24px;margin:12px 0}.event-button{font-size:12px;padding:4px 7px}a{color:inherit}details{margin-top:16px}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}@media(max-width:700px){main{padding:23px 14px}header{display:block}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.panel{padding:17px}h1{font-size:24px}}
</style></head><body><main><header><div><div class="brand">OPUS ZIMBABWE \xB7 PRIVATE OPERATIONS</div><h1>WhatsApp sender &amp; delivery tracker</h1><p class="muted">Provider checks send no messages. Local safety pauses protect outgoing traffic. This page cannot send test messages.</p></div><a href="/sysadmin/">Back to administration</a></header>
<div class="controls"><button id="refresh" class="primary">Refresh records</button><button id="verify">Verify configured sender with Meta</button><button id="health">Check Meta messaging health</button><button id="download">Download diagnostic report</button><button id="resume">Resume after Meta review</button></div><p id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
<section class="panel"><h2>Configured sender</h2><div class="grid"><div><div class="label">Phone Number ID</div><div id="sender-id" class="value">Loading\u2026</div></div><div><div class="label">Meta display phone number</div><div id="sender-number" class="value">Not verified yet</div></div><div><div class="label">Verified business name</div><div id="sender-name" class="value">Not verified yet</div></div><div><div class="label">Number quality</div><div id="quality" class="value">Unknown</div></div><div><div class="label">WABA ID (Meta health/webhook)</div><div id="waba" class="value">Unknown</div></div><div><div class="label">Identity checked</div><div id="checked" class="value">Not checked</div></div><div><div class="label">Meta app ID (health response)</div><div id="app-id" class="value">Unknown</div></div><div><div class="label">Meta messaging health</div><div id="health-status" class="value">Not checked</div></div></div><p id="pause" class="notice"></p><small>High/green phone quality is normally healthy. It does not establish that the business account has no restrictions. Verification uses a Meta GET request; it sends no message and does not remove restrictions.</small></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>Service-reply policy</h2><p>No approved templates are configured. Business-initiated outreach, marketing and messages outside the 24-hour customer-service window are disabled. STOP blocks all further sends to that contact; only a customer START can restore service replies. START is not marketing consent.</p><p>AI requests for human help pause automation for that contact. Staff replies remain possible unless the contact requested STOP.</p><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Contact</th><th>STOP status</th><th>Human assistance</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody id="preferences"></tbody></table></div></section><section class="panel"><h2>Captured events</h2><p class="muted">Times are displayed in Africa/Harare. Open an event for structured Meta codes, details, trace IDs, provider/model and triggering inbound reference.</p><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Recorded</th><th>Event</th><th>Sender ID</th><th>Recipient</th><th>Message / result</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody id="events"></tbody></table></div><pre id="event-detail" hidden></pre><button id="older">Load older events</button></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>Recent conversation messages</h2><p class="muted">Legacy records confirm conversation recipients, but do not prove the historical sender number or generating model. A recent sender verification must not be retroactively assigned to old messages.</p><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Recorded</th><th>Event time</th><th>Direction / type</th><th>Recipient</th><th>Status / attempts</th><th>Text</th><th>Sender provenance</th></tr></thead><tbody id="messages"></tbody></table></div></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>What this can establish</h2><p>The tracker captures the configured sender ID for each send, Meta identity lookup results, signed incoming business-number metadata, recipients, AI provider/model and whether an AI reply had an inbound trigger. It records request acceptance, delivery events and the error reasons Meta actually supplies.</p><p>It cannot manufacture an unreported ban reason. Code 131031 can mean account restriction/disablement or an account-verification mismatch. Review the exact notice in WhatsApp Manager or Meta Business Support.</p><p>Account/quality notices appear only when Meta sends the corresponding subscribed webhook fields. There is no automatic polling, appeal, registration, template sending or retry of uncertain sends. Audit events are retained for 90 days.</p></section></main><script nonce="${nonce}">
(()=>{'use strict';const endpoint='/api/admin/whatsapp';let data=null;const el=id=>document.getElementById(id);const time=x=>{if(!x)return '\u2014';try{return new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-GB',{timeZone:'Africa/Harare',dateStyle:'medium',timeStyle:'medium'}).format(new Date(x))}catch{return String(x)}};const message=(s,error=false)=>{el('status').textContent=s;el('status').className=error?'error':''};
async function api(body){const r=await fetch(endpoint+(body?'':'?diagnostics=1'),{method:body?'POST':'GET',headers:body?{'content-type':'application/json'}:{},body:body?JSON.stringify(body):undefined,credentials:'same-origin',cache:'no-store'});let d;try{d=await r.json()}catch{throw Error('Sign in to administration and reopen this page.')}if(!r.ok)throw Error(d.error||d.hint||'Request failed');return d}
function cell(row,text){const td=document.createElement('td');td.textContent=text==null?'\u2014':String(text);row.append(td);return td}
function events(rows,append=false){if(!append)el('events').replaceChildren();for(const e of rows){const tr=document.createElement('tr');cell(tr,time(e.created_at));cell(tr,e.event_type);cell(tr,e.phone_number_id);cell(tr,e.recipient_phone);const d=e.details||{};cell(tr,d.code?'Meta '+d.code+(d.subcode?' / '+d.subcode:''):(d.ai_provider?d.ai_provider+(d.ai_model?' \xB7 '+d.ai_model:''):(d.reason||e.message_id||d.status||'\u2014')));const td=cell(tr,'');const button=document.createElement('button');button.textContent='Inspect';button.className='event-button';button.onclick=()=>{el('event-detail').hidden=false;el('event-detail').textContent=JSON.stringify(e,null,2)};td.append(button);el('events').append(tr)}if(!rows.length&&!append){const tr=document.createElement('tr');cell(tr,'No events captured yet. Legacy records are below.');el('events').append(tr)}}
function render(d){data=d;const s=d.sender||{};el('sender-id').textContent=d.configured_phone_number_id||'Not configured';el('sender-number').textContent=s.display_phone_number||'Not verified yet';el('sender-name').textContent=s.verified_name||'Not verified yet';el('quality').textContent=s.quality_rating||'Unknown';el('waba').textContent=s.waba_id||'Unknown';el('app-id').textContent=s.app_id||'Unknown';let health;try{health=JSON.parse(s.health_json||'null')}catch{}el('health-status').textContent=(health?.can_send_message||'Not checked')+(s.health_checked_at?' \xB7 '+time(s.health_checked_at):'');el('checked').textContent=time(s.identity_checked_at);el('pause').textContent=s.blocked_at?'LOCAL SEND PAUSE'+(s.blocked_code?' \xB7 Meta '+s.blocked_code:' \xB7 Meta health BLOCKED')+' \xB7 '+(s.blocked_reason||'Review required'):'No local restriction pause recorded. This is not a guarantee of Meta account status.';el('resume').disabled=!s.blocked_at;events(d.events);el('preferences').replaceChildren();for(const pref of d.contact_preferences||[]){const tr=document.createElement('tr');cell(tr,pref.recipient_phone);cell(tr,pref.stopped?'Stopped \u2014 customer START required':'Service replies allowed within 24 hours');cell(tr,pref.human_hold?'Automation paused for human help':'No human hold');const td=cell(tr,'');if(pref.human_hold&&!pref.stopped){const button=document.createElement('button');button.textContent='Resume AI after human help';button.onclick=async()=>{try{await api({action:'diagnostics_resume_contact',phone:pref.recipient_phone});await refresh()}catch(e){message(e.message,true)}};td.append(button)}el('preferences').append(tr)}if(!(d.contact_preferences||[]).length){const tr=document.createElement('tr');cell(tr,'No STOP or human-handoff preferences recorded yet.');el('preferences').append(tr)}el('messages').replaceChildren();for(const m of d.recent_messages){const tr=document.createElement('tr');cell(tr,time(m.created_at));cell(tr,time(m.occurred_at));cell(tr,m.direction+' / '+m.message_type);cell(tr,m.recipient_phone);cell(tr,m.state+' / '+m.attempts);cell(tr,m.body);cell(tr,m.sender_captured?'See captured send event':'Legacy: sender/model not captured');el('messages').append(tr)}}
async function refresh(){try{render(await api());message('Records refreshed. No message was sent.')}catch(e){message(e.message,true)}}
el('refresh').onclick=refresh;el('verify').onclick=async()=>{el('verify').disabled=true;try{await api({action:'diagnostics_verify_sender'});await refresh();message('Sender identity verified with Meta. No message was sent.')}catch(e){message(e.message,true);await refresh();message(e.message,true)}finally{el('verify').disabled=false}};
el('health').onclick=async()=>{el('health').disabled=true;try{const result=await api({action:'diagnostics_verify_health'});await refresh();el('event-detail').hidden=false;el('event-detail').textContent=JSON.stringify(result.health,null,2);message('Meta health checked. No message was sent.')}catch(e){await refresh();message(e.message,true)}finally{el('health').disabled=false}};
el('resume').onclick=async()=>{if(!confirm('Confirm you reviewed and resolved the Meta restriction. This only removes the local pause; cancelled and uncertain messages will not be resent.'))return;try{await api({action:'diagnostics_resume',confirmed:true});await refresh()}catch(e){message(e.message,true)}};
el('download').onclick=()=>{if(!data)return;const blob=new Blob([JSON.stringify(data,null,2)],{type:'application/json'}),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='opus-whatsapp-diagnostics-'+new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)+'.json';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)};
el('older').onclick=async()=>{if(!data?.events?.length)return;try{const before=data.events[data.events.length-1].created_at;const r=await fetch(endpoint+'?diagnostics=1&before='+encodeURIComponent(before)+'&before_id='+encodeURIComponent(data.events[data.events.length-1].id),{credentials:'same-origin',cache:'no-store'});if(!r.ok)throw Error('Could not load older events');const d=await r.json();events(d.events,true);data.events.push(...d.events);message(d.events.length?'Older events loaded':'No older events')}catch(e){message(e.message,true)}};refresh();})();
<\/script></body></html>`;
